# API conventions

- Routers: request parsing, status codes, HTTP errors, response construction.
- Services: business logic and domain behavior.
- Pydantic models: request/response contracts.
- Prefer explicit type hints; avoid returning untyped dicts when a response schema exists.
- Translate domain exceptions to HTTP errors at the router boundary.
- Do not make service code depend unnecessarily on FastAPI.
